1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
Keyword: Combine

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:06,840
Play a copy of a hero already deployed
to trigger Combine.

3
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:10,440
Each Combine raises that hero's
level by 3.

4
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:12,380
After combining three times,

5
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:16,620
you receive a Trick card
at your current tactician level.

6
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:24,428
The small card icon on the right
shows your Combine progress.
